WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:01.370
Why ‘a lot of work’,

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:02.952
but ‘four tasks’?

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:06.184
She types, plans,
calls and cleans.

00:00:06.224 --> 00:00:07.922
Several actions.

00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:09.337
But work,
meaning her daily

00:00:09.377 --> 00:00:11.005
effort, names all
of that as one

00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:12.613
ongoing activity.

00:00:13.137 --> 00:00:13.477
So:

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:15.360
‘She does a lot
of work every day.’

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.751
Not ‘many works’.

00:00:17.703 --> 00:00:18.971
To count
the actions,

00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:20.302
choose another noun:

00:00:20.342 --> 00:00:22.781
‘She completes four
tasks every day.’

00:00:23.503 --> 00:00:25.635
And ‘three
works of art’?

00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:26.223
Correct.

00:00:26.263 --> 00:00:27.683
Here works means
created pieces.

00:00:27.723 --> 00:00:28.824
The meaning
has changed,

00:00:28.864 --> 00:00:30.765
so the grammar
changes too.

